":"告别万艾可","avatar":"658e93a2c063c84b8896c1e4"},"text":"由于各种音乐的风格不同，其实除非刻意去抄，否则很难做成是那种特别雷同的音乐。一般的规避方法，一是制作时多用自己调的合成器音色，二是多用自己录的采样。现在常见的撞车案例多出现在流行乐上，在写四大件的和弦与旋律时那只能靠编曲人的听歌的经验来进行脱敏了。","time":1615764244569,"floor":11,"likes":6,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"415336050":{"pages":["comments/1147002/threads/415336050/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"415336050","root":"415336050","user":{"id":"12700395","name":"春江水暖鸦先知","avatar":"b82128ee54b3349767b2385a"},"text":"知网吧[emot=acfun,1689/]最近在肝论文看见查重心里就一紧[emot=acfun,1701/]","time":1615763541462,"floor":6,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}},"415335727":{"pages":["comments/1147002/threads/415335727/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"415335727","root":"415335727","user":{"id":"12789132","name":"安然语伤","avatar":"fd2080313e424145485aecd6"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1878/]靠记忆查重吧","time":1615763480485,"floor":5,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}}},"commentPages":["comments/1147002/all/1.json","comments/1147002/all/2.json"],"hotPages":[],"hotCount":0},"media":{"142c4a8736063fd71cb7b0f6":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/ylFKRbfpeWWmrN7MjBYjuLDNIUnGuAMw.jpg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/lLwMAuyKc0-ANVbq2-6V7Vri-RNrQBv-UjQjQr.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/style/image/201907/ylFKRbfpeWWmrN7MjBYjuLDNIUnGuAMw.jpg"]},"2c1134ddaa546a13b37bb6ef":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/210656_bb5dd4eb9e6d46ca8d68f9a51cb94d60.jpg","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/42HfTogUkP-Q3Qjui-2a2QFr-eaeqEj-uQfyQv.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/210656_bb5dd4eb9e6d46ca8d68f9a51cb94d60.jpg"]},"431d3647a2d8a988c34b8ca7